WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,740
Who knows if there are any monsters with gang affiliations in the community?

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,140
It stinks to have sex in the room

3
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,830
Not even in the corridor.

4
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:15,230
Today the mall actually sold bread again.

5
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:18,070
This resulted in the value of the bread in my hand not increasing at all.

6
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,790
I finished the only bottle of mineral water.

7
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,910
It’s really a storm in Ulu and it rains all night

8
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:26,060
There are still three gold coins left to collect ten strenuous hearts.

9
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,740
But if you don’t buy some wood before the monster invades today,

10
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,340
It always feels like it’s not safe enough

11
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,540
What if the monster is very aggressive today?

12
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:35,140
It is very dangerous to repair the door in time without wood

13
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,420
My talent has no fighting ability at all

14
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,900
If the door is broken, you will die.

15
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,920
Sixteen silver pens can buy eight pieces of wood

16
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,920
The price is much cheaper than yesterday

17
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,340
Wait and see how hard the little girl hits the door

18
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,780
If it's strong, just buy it. If it's not, forget it.
